{"version":1,"content":"<p>廉政公署落案起訴清潔公司莊臣兩名時任高層，兩人涉嫌在採購清潔車輛及清潔車輛維修服務時，收賄合共逾7500元萬元。</p><p>案件今早（2日）在觀塘裁判法院提堂。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:40:52.920496+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":75,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T01:23:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T13:38:21.734614+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:38:11.157586+00:00","content_hash":"b41827768317149079bd6e8958a2c2b28078e8929cc09ae28be97485643f8f7e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}